WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.694
Skim to find the gist; scan for a precise fact; read closely to connect main ideas

00:00:05.694 --> 00:00:07.411
and supporting details in order.

00:00:08.283 --> 00:00:13.423
“Abena returned a lost purse to its owner.” Which value does the action show? Answer:

00:00:13.423 --> 00:00:13.766
Honesty

00:00:14.617 --> 00:00:20.245
Read a short nonfiction text, identify its main idea, scan for two facts and justify

00:00:20.245 --> 00:00:20.995
your answer.

00:00:21.867 --> 00:00:24.661
Why it works: Returning property shows honesty.
